# SHUTTERBUG: wisps fade in and out; while faded they can't be hurt (shots
# pass through) and can't hurt. A photo makes one solid, and then it can be
# shot down, for double points.
game shutterbug
cheat run 1
cheat quiet
cheat stop
cheat clear
cheat pos 40 84
cheat foe 15 210 84 0
waituntil fstate_15 == 2 200
hold B
wait 30
expect hp_15 == 4
expect foes_15 == 1
release B
press A
expect stun_15 > 200
hold B 40
expect foes_15 == 0
expect score == 600
